# Vue / TDesign conventions

## Stack

Vue 3 `<script setup lang="ts">`, Pinia, vue-router, TDesign Vue Next, `tdesign-icons-vue-next`, path alias `@/`.

## Components

- Prefer TDesign primitives (`t-button`, `t-popup`, `t-radio-group`, …) over custom chrome
- Icons from `tdesign-icons-vue-next` (named `*Icon` exports)
- Colocate `<style scoped>` with the SFC; share tokens via CSS variables, not duplicated hex
- Auto-imported TDesign components are fine; still import icons and local components explicitly

## State & text

- File list / persistence → `useFilesStore()`
- Copy → `useI18n().t`
- Theme → `useTheme()` / `setColorScheme`
- User feedback → `MessagePlugin` / `DialogPlugin` with translated strings

## Keep changes focused

- Match existing Browse/Edit patterns before inventing new layout systems
- When adding UI copy or colors, update i18n + light/dark tokens in the same change
